## 3. Generating Document Outputs (Word .docx)

When the user needs a formal document (purchase requisition, audit report, etc.):

```bash
# Install python-docx (one-time)
uv pip install --system python-docx

# Write script, run from terminal (NOT from execute_code — sandbox doesn't
# see system packages)
python3 /tmp/gen_report.py
```

The `execute_code` sandbox does **not** have access to system/site-packages installed via `--system`. Always write the script as a file and run via `terminal(command="python3 /tmp/script.py")`.

